    ||w||² =   24: H ∈ [5], count = 240
    ||w||² =   32: H ∈ [3], count = 120
    ||w||² =   40: H ∈ [1], count = 120

  JOINT (Tr(B^4), ||w||²) CLASSIFICATION:
